{"unit_id":"uckkk__dsh-iconography#card-zh","repo":"uckkk/dsh-iconography","commit":"b5ec54a57cb5324786e177afd551f6494d8e1a82","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-iconography 是一款 DSH 工具插件，可在会话中查询图标设计参考。它注册三个工具，分别列出图标风格、返回栅格绘制要点和提供图标设计一致性规范。风格参考涵盖线性、面性、双色调、彩色和字形图标；栅格建议涉及画布、安全区、对齐、关键线和描边。适合需要快速查阅界面图标视觉规范的设计与开发工作流。无需额外 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:32-76"]}
{"unit_id":"uckkk__dsh-iconography#card-en","repo":"uckkk/dsh-iconography","commit":"b5ec54a57cb5324786e177afd551f6494d8e1a82","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-iconography is a DSH tool plugin for icon design references. Three tools list styles, explain grid drawing, and give consistency rules for perspective, spacing and naming. It helps designers and developers check interface icon guidance in a session, with no API key or external service.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:7-29","lib/index.js:32-76"]}
